{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301706","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301706","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230170601:1":{"text":"조급한 건 화물을 의뢰한 상인들이겠지.","source_cn":"着急的是委托运输货物的商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA000F8EA05905BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230170602:1":{"text":"당장 내일 목적지까지 데려다 달라고 매일 찾아와서 채근하고 있어.","source_cn":"他们每天都来催船长，恨不得我们明天就到达目的地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC821B5BFE59570AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230170603:1":{"text":"하지만 그들을 탓할 수는 없지. 항로가 막 열린 지금, 바깥에서 러스트 항의 물건은 없어서 못 파는 수준이니.","source_cn":"这也不怪他们，毕竟航路刚开，锈锚港的货物在外面可都是抢手货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF40969A8EEB710B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230170604:1":{"text":"시간은 곧 돈일세. 그러니 지체하지 말고 돛을 올려 항해를 준비하지!","source_cn":"时间就是金钱。不能耽搁了，扬起风帆，准备出航！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BE389C9B36FADE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水手欧米拉":{"text":"선원 오마라","source":"水手欧米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:船长布莱杰":{"text":"선장 브리짓","source":"船长布莱杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}